\[c =Se^{(b-r)T}N(d_{1})-Xe^{-rT}N(d_{2}) \tag{1.22}\] \[p =Xe^{-rT}N(-d_{2})-Se^{(b-r)T}N(-d_{1}), \tag{1.23}\]

