### 7.5 Three-dimensional Binomial Trees

**Application**

American spread options are traded on the New York Mercantile Exchange on oil products. The heating oil crack is an option on the spread between heating oil and crude oil. The gasoline crack is an option on the spread between unleaded gasoline and crude oil. Crack spread options are useful to oil refineries for hedging purposes.

Maximum, minimum, and dual-strike options have been traded in the OTC market on commodities and stock indexes. The three-dimensional binomial model is extremely flexible. Adding a new type of option to the model can, in most cases, be achieved by a small adjustment in the payoff function.

