The _SwaptionVol_(\(\cdot\)) function returns the swap volatility given the one-year FRA volatilities and their correlations. The function is limited to calculate the volatility of swaps with full years to maturity, from annual forward rates (FRAs). It can be easily extended to cover swaps, for example, starting three months from now and based on, for example, three-month FRAs. I leave this extension up to the reader. See the accompanying spreadsheet on the CD to attain a better understanding of how to use the function.

